OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Fdrizzly rain gradually clearing
OL,7,Fnortheastwards through the night. Once
OL,8,Fit clears, drier conditions and some
OL,9,Fclearer spells possible, before
OL,10,Ffurther rain pushes into the southwest
OL,11,Fby dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FWet for much of Wednesday
OL,14,Fwith rain gradually clearing to the
OL,15,Fnortheast leaving some brighter
OL,16,Fperiods to end the day. Initially
OL,17,Fcalm, although winds picking up
OL,18,Fquickly during the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
