OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBrighter skies and lighter winds
OL,7,FThursday. A spell of wet and very
OL,8,Fwindy weather arrives overnight into
OL,9,FFriday and continues until early
OL,10,FSaturday when another brief settled
OL,11,Fspell returns.
